  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "What is SEO?",
      "a": "<p>SEO means making your site easy for search engines to find, read and trust. As a result, your pages show up when people search for what you sell.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "How long does SEO take to work?",
      "a": "<p>Most sites see the first gains in 3 to 6 months. Local searches and new pages with little competition can move faster.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "What is the difference between SEO and AEO?",
      "a": "<p>SEO aims for the blue links on Google. AEO aims for direct answers, such as featured snippets, People Also Ask boxes and voice answers.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I do SEO myself?",
      "a": "<p>Yes, for a small site. Our <a href=\"/tag/seo-course/\">free SEO course</a> and the free tools in our <a href=\"/tag/seo-tools/\">SEO tools guide</a> cover the basics.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Which SEO guide should I read first?",
      "a": "<p>Start with the SEO beginner's guide. Then use the four questions on this page to pick your next step.</p>"
    }
  ],
